{"2470830": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Repeat After Me", "steam_appid": 2470830, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Repeat After Me, the multiplayer game for single players! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sounds contradictory? Make this work, by utilizing your unique ability of cloning yourself at any time and record any action you can think of. Your clones will forever repeat your every step - or misstep. Can you work with yourself? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470830/extras/d1f11aab6578b243527fb25abaa81cbc.poster.avif?t=1755289362\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470830/extras/d1f11aab6578b243527fb25abaa81cbc.webm?t=1755289362\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470830/extras/d1f11aab6578b243527fb25abaa81cbc.mp4?t=1755289362\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this third-person puzzle game, you play as Plamb who is trapped in a magical confinement and longs to escape. To progress on this quest, many different puzzles are blocking your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470830/extras/518c0bca166dde29c1061c4ce9a8a195.poster.avif?t=1755289362\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470830/extras/518c0bca166dde29c1061c4ce9a8a195.webm?t=1755289362\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470830/extras/518c0bca166dde29c1061c4ce9a8a195.mp4?t=1755289362\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They require many hands but you play alone. Luckily, Plamb has the ability to clone itself multiple times, show each clone a sequence of arbitrary actions and they will keep executing them in a loop forever. With your own helping hands you can now try to find a way out! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470830/extras/d905958ab7e0ecff9ddff0fe7af62cab.poster.avif?t=1755289362\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470830/extras/d905958ab7e0ecff9ddff0fe7af62cab.webm?t=1755289362\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470830/extras/d905958ab7e0ecff9ddff0fe7af62cab.mp4?t=1755289362\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Repeat After Me is all about working with yourself, taking on multiple new perspectives on scenarios and finding creative solutions to overcome impossible obstacles. Can you do that? Because cloning comes not without dangers, and you know. You should never meet yourself, who knows what this will break?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470830/extras/ad928739ecc825fc46310df6b520e7c4.poster.avif?t=1755289362\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470830/extras/ad928739ecc825fc46310df6b520e7c4.webm?t=1755289362\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470830/extras/ad928739ecc825fc46310df6b520e7c4.mp4?t=1755289362\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Repeat After Me, the multiplayer game for single players! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sounds contradictory? Make this work, by utilizing your unique ability of cloning yourself at any time and record any action you can think of. Your clones will forever repeat your every step - or misstep. Can you work with yourself? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470830/extras/d1f11aab6578b243527fb25abaa81cbc.poster.avif?t=1755289362\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470830/extras/d1f11aab6578b243527fb25abaa81cbc.webm?t=1755289362\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470830/extras/d1f11aab6578b243527fb25abaa81cbc.mp4?t=1755289362\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this third-person puzzle game, you play as Plamb who is trapped in a magical confinement and longs to escape. To progress on this quest, many different puzzles are blocking your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470830/extras/518c0bca166dde29c1061c4ce9a8a195.poster.avif?t=1755289362\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470830/extras/518c0bca166dde29c1061c4ce9a8a195.webm?t=1755289362\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470830/extras/518c0bca166dde29c1061c4ce9a8a195.mp4?t=1755289362\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They require many hands but you play alone. Luckily, Plamb has the ability to clone itself multiple times, show each clone a sequence of arbitrary actions and they will keep executing them in a loop forever. With your own helping hands you can now try to find a way out! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470830/extras/d905958ab7e0ecff9ddff0fe7af62cab.poster.avif?t=1755289362\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470830/extras/d905958ab7e0ecff9ddff0fe7af62cab.webm?t=1755289362\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470830/extras/d905958ab7e0ecff9ddff0fe7af62cab.mp4?t=1755289362\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Repeat After Me is all about working with yourself, taking on multiple new perspectives on scenarios and finding creative solutions to overcome impossible obstacles. Can you do that? Because cloning comes not without dangers, and you know. You should never meet yourself, who knows what this will break?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470830/extras/ad928739ecc825fc46310df6b520e7c4.poster.avif?t=1755289362\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470830/extras/ad928739ecc825fc46310df6b520e7c4.webm?t=1755289362\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470830/extras/ad928739ecc825fc46310df6b520e7c4.mp4?t=1755289362\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Repeat After Me, the multiplayer game for single players! Clone, act, repeat! Whatever you do, your copies will forever repeat your every step - or misstep. Can you work with yourself to escape?", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470830/3b332b4c32487c79ca7316cbe10bbd675a3475ea/header.jpg?t=1755289362", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470830/5aee411712013a7850c9978d31c20002cd46ca05/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755289362", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470830/5aee411712013a7850c9978d31c20002cd46ca05/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755289362", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5-4590 / AMD Ryzen 5 1500X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GTX 1060 / AMD RX 480<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Jewelz Games"], "publishers": ["Jewelz Games"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 28, "description": "Full controller support"}, {"id": 74, "description": "Playable without Timed Input"}, {"id": 57, "description": "DualSense Controller Support"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "1", "description": "Action"}, {"id": "25", "description": "Adventure"}, {"id": "4", "description": "Casual"}, {"id": "23", "description": "Indie"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 5, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470830/ss_04fa0746052c3c10402ce303fc780fb5b3c829c7.600x338.jpg?t=1755289362", "